  96:../../Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****     (+) To read the RTC Backup Data registers, use the HAL_RTCEx_BKUPRead()
  97:../../Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****         function.
