2402:../../Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****   * @param  SmoothCalibPlusPulses Select to Set or reset the CALP bit.
2403:../../Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
2404:../../Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****   *             @arg RTC_SMOOTHCALIB_PLUSPULSES_SET: Add one RTCCLK pulse every 2*11 pulses.
2405:../../Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****   *             @arg RTC_SMOOTHCALIB_PLUSPULSES_RESET: No RTCCLK pulses are added.
2406:../../Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****   * @param  SmoothCalibMinusPulsesValue Select the value of CALM[8:0] bits.
2407:../../Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****   *          This parameter can be one any value from 0 to 0x000001FF.
2408:../../Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****   * @note   To deactivate the smooth calibration, the field SmoothCalibPlusPulses
2409:../../Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****   *         must be equal to SMOOTHCALIB_PLUSPULSES_RESET and the field
2410:../../Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h7xx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****   *         SmoothCalibMinusPulsesValue must be equal to 0.
